        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "2398db0f-6986-525d-8a22-4f143d07ced3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 917,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.200:block:3",
          "start": 866
        },
        "quote": "(2) In a new manufactured home park or subdivision;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.200:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.30.200 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "1b1bd41c-dcb0-5625-9ae7-8f93887325fa",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 994,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.200:block:4",
          "start": 918
        },
        "quote": "(3) In an expansion to an existing manufactured home park or subdivision; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.200:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.30.200 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "8853c742-9257-59f9-bd87-9b39e8d78343",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1654,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.200:block:5",
          "start": 995
        },
        "quote": "(4) In an existing manufactured home park or subdivision on which a manufactured or mobile home has incurred substantial damage as the result of a flood, be elevated on a permanent foundation such that the lowest floor of the manufactured home is elevated a minimum of one foot above the base flood elevation and be securely attached to an adequately anchored foundation system to resist flotation, collapse, and lateral movement. All mechanical and heating ventilation equipment to be elevated to same level of one foot above the base flood elevation. The elevation of the lowest floor shall be certified by a licensed land surveyor or professional engineer.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.200:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.30.200 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "57b0a130-231f-55d7-823b-b0ac93a2c4f5",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2310,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.200:block:6",
          "start": 1655
        },
        "quote": "(c) Manufactured or mobile homes that are placed or substantially improved on sites in an existing manufactured home park or subdivision within all unnumbered and numbered A zones, AE zones and AH zones, on the community’s FIRM, that are not subject to the provisions of subsection (b) of this section, shall be elevated so that the lowest floor of the manufactured or mobile home is a minimum of one foot above the base flood level. The elevation of the lowest floor shall be certified by a licensed land surveyor or professional engineer. Mechanical and HVAC equipment shall be elevated to the same level as the lowest floor. (Ord. 20425 § 11, 6-20-23.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.200:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
